flowchart LR
    %% Data Flow Diagram Level 0 - Context Diagram
    Candidate[("fa:fa-user Job Seeker / Candidate")]
    SystemCore[["0.0<br/>Online Resume Builder<br/>& PDF Generation System"]]
    Database[("fa:fa-database PostgreSQL / Supabase<br/>Resumes & Users Store")]

    %% Flows from Candidate to System
    Candidate -->|"1. Registration / Login Credentials"| SystemCore
    Candidate -->|"2. Profile Details & Avatar File"| SystemCore
    Candidate -->|"3. Resume Data (Personal, Edu, Exp, Skills)"| SystemCore
    Candidate -->|"4. Template & Theme Choices"| SystemCore
    Candidate -->|"5. PDF Generation Request"| SystemCore

    %% Flows from System to Candidate
    SystemCore -->|"6. Auth Token & Session State"| Candidate
    SystemCore -->|"7. Live Formatted Resume Preview"| Candidate
    SystemCore -->|"8. Validation Alerts & Field Feedback"| Candidate
    SystemCore -->|"9. Downloadable Formatted PDF File"| Candidate

    %% Flows between System and Database
    SystemCore -->|"10. Store/Update User Credentials & Drafts"| Database
    Database -->|"11. Retrieve Saved Profiles & Resumes"| SystemCore
